se students appeared to enjoy the game approach, regardless of their math skill. \n\nIn August 2021, MOE called for bids for the development, piloting, and implementation of an AI system to provide feedback on English language writing. The system, to be deployed in 2023, will provide personalized feedback to improve students' English language writing skills by correcting their grammar, sentence structure, and expression. 28 An MOE official noted that it would later consider rolling out similar systems for other languages.",
