        "text": "• Strengths: Automated feedback improves efficiency. \n\n• Weaknesses: Over-reliance on AI may reduce learner autonomy and critical thinking. \n\n• Threats: Erosion of teacher authority. \n\nA balanced approach is necessary, where AI-generated assessments and feedback complement-but do not override-human judgment. Students should be guided to critically assess AI-generated content, fostering media literacy and reflective thinking. \n\nMaintaining this balance preserves human agency in learning and sustains the vital teacher-student relationship.",
